  "name": "Economy log: CoA cache scripts that put their rewards straight in the bags log what they give",
  "contract": [
    "With the economy log on, a cache that skips the loot window writes one cache_open row per item it gives (and one for its gold), with the cache entry as source; a store or upgrade writes its own row.",
    "Heroic Dungeon Callboard Cache 1615001 (open packet) gives one gear piece and 1 to 15 gold: two rows.",
    "Adventurer's Cache 1397886 at level 12 gives one green item and supplies: at least two rows.",
    "Prestigious Cache (Heroic Dungeons) 1287304 gives one gear piece and sometimes one or two tokens: one to three rows.",
    "Cache of the Fire Lord 2400040 gives one raid item: one row.",
    "Rune of Descension Pouch (12,500) 509872 pays 12500 Rune of Descension 375250: one row with that count.",
    "The Ethereal Tool Dispenser 8263501 with a Runed Arcanite Rod 16207 becomes Ethereal Tool Dispenser I 8263502: one reward row with the old dispenser as cost item and source 9 (tool dispenser).",
    "Buying the Necromancer Class Bundle 2615021 through the custom store (0x06BB) with a Conquest of Azeroth Class Bundle 2499003 writes one store_buy row with the bundle token as cost and source 11 (class bundle store).",
    "Reaching 150 Callboard points with four elite Callboard quests (18034, 18036, 18104, 18109: 25 each) and the world boss quest 170015 (50) pays an unequipped level 60 character the Adventurer's Cache 1397886: one reward row with source 7 (Call Board)."
  ],
